  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>. If for some&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>48</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2160</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>96</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______."
  },
